, and Nuclear and Particle Physics.\nFor degree requirements, graduate courses, and application information, see link to the program of interest below.\nPhysics - M.A.\nPhysics - M.S.\nPhysics - Ph.D.\nProspective graduate students interested in joining the department can find more information about applying to our program here.\nCurrent students may find these resources helpful.\nGraduate Programs\nFor Prospective Physics Graduate Students\nGraduate Applications FAQs\nInformation and Policy Guide\nDepartmental Graduate Awards\nFor Current Physics Graduate Students\nPhysics\nCollege of Sciences and Humanities\nQuick Links\nAbout\nAcademics\nAdmissions\nAlumni\nAthletics\nCampus Safety\nJobs & Employment\nLife at KSU\nLocations\nNews\nOur Research\nNeed Help?\nRequest Admissions Information\nFor the Media\nWebsite Feedback\nPolicies and Compliance\nAnnual Security Reports\nCampus Concerns Reporting\nPrivacy Statement\nSenate Bill 1 Compliance\nWeb Accessibility\nContact\nPhone\n330-672-2246\nEmail\nphysics-web@kent.edu\nAddress\n103 Smith Hall, Kent State University, Kent, OH 44242\nFacebook\n\u00a9 2026 Kent State University All rights reserved.", "links": [["Skip to main content", "https://www.kent.edu/physics/graduate-study-phd-physics-program#main-content"], ["", "https://www.kent.edu/kent"], ["Apply", "https://www.kent.edu/admissions/apply"], ["Visit", "https://www.kent.edu/admissions/tours-events"], ["Give Now", "https://connect.kent.edu/portal/give-to?tab=COLLEGE-CAS"], ["FlashLine Login", "https://flashline.kent.edu"], ["Calendars", "https://www.kent.edu/calendars"], ["Phone Directory", "https://keys.kent.edu/ePROD/bwgkphon.p_viewpeopledirectory"], ["Maps & Directions", "https://map.concept3d.com/?id=568"], ["Search", "https://www.kent.edu/"], ["Physics", "https://www.kent.edu/physics"], ["College of Sciences and Humanities", "https://www.kent.edu/sh"], ["Menu", "https://www.kent.edu/physics/graduate-study-phd-physics-program"], ["Search", "https://www.kent.e